name tatoeba-sentences
# Tatoeba's sentences: each row gives a sentence's Tatoeba number, its language (ISO 639-3) and its text. A curated
# source: what is recorded is each sentence, as content, and the claim [sentence, lang, code] it attests.
match sentences.csv
grammar tsv
records
# A witness entering unrated plays at Glicko-2's stock deviation (350, trust 0.67); its trust is then earned by its
# agreement with higher-tier witnesses (Research: Trust).
trust 0.67
predicate lang
query
(row . (field) . (field) @object.text . (field) @subject.text)
end
